# Task Authoring

## instruction.md

- Concise, realistic engineering prompt (what, not how)
- Absolute paths only (`/app/config.yaml`, not `config.yaml`)
- No step-by-step solution guides or hints
- spec.md must read like real engineering docs, not prompt extensions

## task.toml

```toml
version = "2.0"
[environment]
allow_internet = false  # REQUIRED
```

- `number_of_milestones` must equal `[[steps]]` count (0 if non-milestone)
- `category` — one of 9 types (see `docs/task-type-taxonomy.md`)
- `subcategories` — long_context, tool_specific, api_integration, db_interaction, ui_building

## Milestone Tasks

Each milestone under `steps/milestone_N/` with own instruction.md, tests/, solution/.
No root-level instruction.md, tests/, solution/, or milestone_x.md.
